      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I can confirm that 5cm is around where the QM starts being a bit wonky from prior experimentation with custom scaling (unsure if changing the nearclip setting has any effect on this, probably does) and so perhaps that factors into the equation somehow.\n\nI wish I had a public avatar ID that went that small to help with reproduction, but I do not. I thiiiiiink I have the cherub bot package downloaded somewhere so I might upload a version of that with scaling for y'all to test. If it would help you, I can also just send you a custom scaling system with some very extreme minimums and maximums so you can throw something up for testing this yourself.",
