      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "QM, and action menu interaction can get wonky at low scales in my experience, but I have not experienced any crashes previously. For the quick menu interaction, there was no way to fix that in older builds. For the action menu; you could set the near clip plane in the main menu to prevent it from disappearing.\n\nBut some updates ago there were some UI interaction improvements and I have not tried scaling that small since. Its possible that situation has gotten better.",
